Motoko compiler plugins

Extracted from the experimental plugin implementation in
https://github.com/caffeinelabs/motoko/pull/6443
at commit 7b95f5589d75e2eb8277ca8579415fe5063a104a.

Source organization, build tools, and test paths were adapted for this
standalone repository. Existing source notices and license files are retained.
The CandidX compiler and runtime directories carry their own MIT license.
Other extracted material retains the Motoko repository license (Apache 2.0
with LLVM exceptions); see LICENSE.

The RSA plugin includes a reduced BearSSL source subset by Thomas Pornin,
distributed under the MIT license. Its license and original-file provenance
are retained in plugins/rsa/runtime/vendor/bearssl/LICENSE.txt and UPSTREAM.json.
